    "Order number check of gp7 (purchases without gifts) against the stock of its own procedure: gp7 orders {0}; in CashUse (items) {1}, matched {2}; in SaleHair (hairstyles) {3}, matched {4}; gp7 only — {5}: no stock row in either, of them in the ItemPostbox mailbox now {6}, the cause is not established from the data; stock only — {7}.",
