  "Продлить подпись канала alpha и version.json — DEPLOY\\Patch\\6_Resign.bat, затем 4_Upload.bat. У канала launcher батника нет: asda_release.py --channel launcher resign и upload.": "To renew the signature of the alpha channel and version.json — DEPLOY\\Patch\\6_Resign.bat, then 4_Upload.bat. The launcher channel has no batch file: asda_release.py --channel launcher resign and upload.",
